&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Abteilungsleiter / Head of Department (m/w/d) – Bezahlte Studie in Deutschland&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;About Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prolific connects researchers and organisations with people from a wide range of professional backgrounds. More than 35,000 researchers and organisations use Prolific to collect high-quality human insights for research and product development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;The opportunity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting professionals currently working as a &lt;strong&gt;Abteilungsleiter / Head of Department in Germany&lt;/strong&gt; to participate in a paid online leadership research study.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The study explores how managers at large organisations approach leadership, decision-making, organisational change, career development, and the growing use of AI in the workplace. Your professional experience will help researchers understand how these developments affect leaders and their teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completing a short online survey in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharing your views on leadership, management, and workplace change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answering questions about your responsibilities and professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing information about the size and type of organisation where you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giving honest, considered responses based on your own experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Who we&#39;re looking for&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may be eligible if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently live and work in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently work as a &lt;strong&gt;Abteilungsleiter / Head of Department&lt;/strong&gt; or in a closely comparable senior role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a department and have responsibility for people, budgets, performance, or departmental strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work for an organisation with &lt;strong&gt;at least 1,000 employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable completing an online survey in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the requirements in the study&#39;s short pre-screening questionnaire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participants may be asked to verify their identity, location, professional background, or other eligibility information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why participate?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your experience will contribute to research into how large organisations can better support managers and employees as leadership expectations and workplace technologies change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a paid research opportunity, not an application for permanent employment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you already have a Prolific account, you do not need to register again. Please ensure your participant profile is complete and up to date.&lt;/p&gt;
